  "core_problem": "Modern workstations get clogged with generated artifacts, caches, dependencies, AI outputs, duplicate media, inactive projects, and large downloads while users do not know what is safe to delete.",
  "core_solution": "Workflow-aware cleanup intelligence that scans local clutter, classifies risk, recommends delete/archive/compress/protect actions, and eventually runs as a lightweight macOS menu bar utility.",
